{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":21,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"53b1f6ee-8b80-423b-80a2-60278c120a04","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511219397,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件评审(J11642)","OrgId":809527,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、电子架构开发科负责车身电子部品、架构、总线等的开发工作。\n2、电子部品硬件评审流程的管理和执行，包括硬件评审日程的制定，硬件评审整个流程的实施；\n3、掌握车规芯片/半导体技术发展趋势，建立国产芯片供应商准入标准及质量评估体系，推动公司芯片白名单扩充；\n4、基于使用场景来建立各部品关键芯片选型标准指南，推动国产芯片导入；\n5、推动整车各控制器硬件芯片方案趋于平台化，提升团队对芯片的认知与运用能力；\n6、参与国产芯片上车后的全生命周期质量管理，支持芯片问题分析及失效排查。","Require":"1.从事汽车电子/芯片领域5年以上工作经验；有芯片FAE工作经验优先\n2.熟悉各种电子元器件、半导体芯片等的规格及应用，理解其工作原理；\n3.善于解读数据手册(datasheet)，能基于使用场景来进行芯片选型；\n4.掌握芯片级可靠性评审规范，了解半导体的失效原理；\n5.有设计和评审电子部品原理图的经验；\n6.具备较强的组织、计划和沟通能力；\n7.具备较强的自信心及灵活应变能力；了解汽车发展趋势，掌握行业发展动态。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-10T15:43:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"dce31b37-abd3-40f0-bc8e-4e2fbdd13272","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511208513,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"法务合规科科长(J11695)","OrgId":0,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责研究公司内外部环境，关注法律法规的变化情况，开展与公司生产经营管理活动相关的法律法规解读及培训活动；\n2、负责公司各项业务的法律咨询（法律意见和/或建议方案）；\n3、负责为公司各项业务提供合法性审查；负责公司争议解决、诉讼案件以及外聘律师管理；\n4、负责协助国家司法机关、工商部门等政府机构相关调查；\n5、负责公司与法律事务相关的其它工作；\n6、负责建立健全公司合规管理体系（含境内外）；\n7、负责建立健全公司内部控制管理体系；\n8、负责建立健全公司合规文化体系；\n9、负责对公司各项业务提供合规咨询；\n10、负责对公司各项业务进行合规性审查；\n11、负责对公司具体业务进行合规性监督；\n12、负责公司员工违反内部规章制度行为处理相关工作；公司或领导交办的其他相关事务。","Require":"1、律师执业资格证书/法律职业资格证书；\n2、8年以上法务合规工作经验，汽车行业及涉外法务合规工作经历者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-08T16:02:41","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"6ce12913-bfb0-44a5-97b5-e404b5adb861","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511178265,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"法务管理(J11615)","OrgId":0,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.合同管理\n1)起草、审核、规范各类合同文本，对各类合同提出法律意见；\n2)合同台账登记，检查监督合同履行情况，协调解决合同履行过程中出现的法律问题；\t\t\n2.诉讼管理\n1）代表公司参与法律事务（纠纷）的协商、调解、诉讼与仲裁活动；\n2）公司外聘法律顾问资源统筹、管理；\t\t\n3.行政执法应对\n配合、协助、应对行政管理机构、公检法等部门的调查、执法；\t\t\n4.日常法律咨询\n1)处理、解答、对应、协助咨询公司及公司各部门的法律事务；\n2）为项目开发、业务开展提供法律保障，提示法律风险；\t\t\n5.企业工商登记（备案）\n负责公司及隶属企业的涉及工商登记（备案）事宜的办理；\t\t\n6.董事会事务对应\n1）对应公司及隶属企业涉及的股东会/董事会相关事务；\n2）负责议案审核、执行落实等；\t\n7.商标管理\n1）处理、解答、对应、回复与商标有关的事宜或者咨询；\n2）与外部代理机构沟通商标查询、注册及日常维护事项；\t\t\t\n8.法律培训\n组织、开展员工法律培训，强化员工法律意识。","Require":"1、法学专业，3 年及以上法律相关工作经验，已通过法律职业资格考试，专业功底扎实，可快速处理各类法律事务；\n2、精通《民法典》《公司法》《产品质量法》《广告法》《知识产权法》《反垄断法》及汽车行业相关法规政策，熟练使用各类法律检索工具；\n3、持有英语四级证书，英语口语流利者优先；\n4、熟练计算机操作，精通 Office 办公软件；\n5、价值观端正，抗压、自主学习能力突出；具备良好沟通、统筹决策、问题处理、创新及团队协作能力，拥有一定管理统筹能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-29T16:33:17","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"c863795c-c0ba-42f6-9b94-fc4088d0dfef","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511163402,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDat